# Kotlin Hooks

> This file extends the common hooks rule with Kotlin-specific content.

## PostToolUse Hooks

Claude Code only — configure in `~/.claude/settings.json`. This Cursor install uses `.cursor/hooks.json` and must not gain a Claude settings file:

- **ktfmt/ktlint**: Auto-format `.kt` and `.kts` files after edit
- **detekt**: Run static analysis after editing Kotlin files
- **./gradlew build**: Verify compilation after changes
